    <briefdescription>
<para>HTTP handler for the AI Plugin Generator API. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Exposes <computeroutput>themis::plugins::ai::AIPluginGenerator</computeroutput> as production HTTP endpoints under <computeroutput>/ai/plugins/</computeroutput>. This header is the production consumer route for the <computeroutput>ai</computeroutput> module — previously the module had only test consumers.</para>
<para><heading level="3">Routes</heading>
</para>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>POST /ai/plugins/generate</computeroutput> — Generate a new plugin artefact.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>GET /ai/plugins/list</computeroutput> — List available / generated plugins.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>GET /ai/plugins/{id}/status</computeroutput> — Poll generation status for a job.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>DELETE /ai/plugins/{id}</computeroutput> — Cancel or delete a plugin job.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><heading level="3">Authentication</heading>
</para>
<para>All routes require a valid ****** validated by <computeroutput>AuthMiddleware</computeroutput>.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>1.0.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Maturity: 🟡 INTEGRATION-READY (wiring to HttpServer pending) </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Production consumer route for <computeroutput>src/ai/</computeroutput> — see <computeroutput>src/ai/ARCHITECTURE.md</computeroutput> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
